      "file": "Architecture Aigent.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "ui",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-620",
      "y": "-160",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "## Interface\n`src/app/` — Next\nport **3987**",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "proxy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-300",
      "y": "-160",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "## Garde\n`src/proxy.ts`\ngarde `/api/agent-ops/**`",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-620",
      "y": "0",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "## API opérateur\n`/api/agent-ops/**`\ncookie ou `x-amc-key`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "rt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-300",
      "y": "0",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "## Surfaces runtime\n`/api/runtime/v1/**`\n`/api/runtime-telemetry`\njetons distincts",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "lg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "40",
      "y": "-160",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "## LangGraph\n`src/langgraph/`\nAPI 1.4.2 — port **2024**\ngraphe `agent_builder`",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "graph",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "40",
      "y": "20",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## agent_builder\n**5 nœuds · 6 arêtes**\n`__start__ → agent`\n`agent ⇄ approval ⇄ tools`\n`agent → __end__`",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "db",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-620",
      "y": "160",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Données\nPostgREST\n`runtime_telemetry_events`\n**38 runs observés**",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "metrics",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-300",
      "y": "160",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Métriques\n`/api/agent-ops/metrics`\nformat Prometheus\nserver-only",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "lf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "40",
      "y": "220",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "## Langfuse\nport **3801**\nprojet `aigent-local`\ntraces de run",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "prom",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "360",
      "y": "160",
      "width": 240,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "## Prometheus\nport **3804**\nscrape 15 s",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "graf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "360",
      "y": "290",
      "width": 240,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "## Grafana\nport **3802**\ndashboard `aigent-runs`",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "40",
      "y": "360",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "## n8n\nport **3803**\nveille de santé de flotte",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "360",
      "y": "-160",
      "width": 240,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "## Consommateur\nexécute l'agent livré\nrapporte ses runs\n`active_in_consumer: unknown`",
      "color": "6"
    }
